  "reason": "The completed runs show that multiprofile RNA with scvi_n200 is much stronger than singleprofile RNA, while avgpool and transformer aggregation are nearly equivalent, but there is still no evidence that the image modality is useful. config_011 tests an image-only baseline in the promising multiprofile regime using a simple standard encoder (resnet50) and simple aggregation (avgpool), without adding fusion. This is the best next experiment because it isolates the image representation question, provides the baseline needed to interpret future multimodal/fusion experiments, and avoids committing budget to a more complex multimodal or ViT-L setup before knowing whether image features contain signal."
}

